  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Je t\u2019interdis de r\xE9v\xE9ler ces informations,
    va reposer ce journal"
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - Mais ! Captain, je tenais enfin le moyen de la calmer !
    - "Bon tant pis, on va continuer \xE0 subir son sale caract\xE8re\u2026\r\n"
